hadiths[12]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1456","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Qatada (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Khwab Allah ki taraf se hai aur bura khwab shaitan ki taraf se hai. Phir jab tum mein se koi na-pasandeeda cheez dekhe to use chahiye ke bedar hote waqt teen martaba thuthkare aur us ke shar se panah mange. Kyunke wo use nuqsan nahi degi."
"1457","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab zamana qareeb ho to momin ka khwab mushkil se jhoota hoga. Aur momin ka khwab nabuwwat ke chhiyalis hisson mein se ek hissa hai."
"1458","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ubada bin al-Samit (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Momin ka khwab nabuwwat ke chhiyalis hisson mein se ek hissa hai."
"1459","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Momin ka khwab nabuwwat ke chhiyalis hisson mein se ek hissa hai."
"1460","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Momin ka khwab nabuwwat ke chhiyalis hisson mein se ek hissa hai."
"1461","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Jis ne mujhe khwab mein dekha wo anqareeb mujhe bedari mein dekhega. Aur shaitan meri surat nahi bana sakta."
"1462","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke ek shakhs Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya. Phir us ne kaha: Beshak main ne aaj raat khwab mein badal dekha jis se ghee aur shehed tapak raha tha. Phir main logon ko dekhta hun ke wo us mein se le rahe hain. Zyada lene wala aur kam lene wala. Aur rassi mili hui zameen se aasman tak. Phir main tumhe dekhta hun ke tum ne use pakda aur upar chadhe. Phir usے doosre shakhs ne pakda aur us se upar chadha. Phir usے doosre shakhs ne pakda aur us se upar chadha. Phir usے doosre shakhs ne pakda to toot gayi. Phir jodi gayi. Phir Abu Bakr ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mere maan-baap Aap par fida hon. Allah ki qasam! Tum mujhe zaroor chhoroge ke main us ki tabeer karun. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tabeer karo. Unhon ne kaha: Raha badal wo Islam hai. Aur raha jo shehed aur ghee mein se tapak raha hai wo Quran hai. Us ki mithas tapak rahi hai. Phir Quran se zyada lene wala aur kam lene wala. Aur rahi mili hui rassi aasman se zameen tak wo haq hai jis par tum ho. Tum use pakadte ho aur Allah tumhe buland karta hai. Phir usے tumhare baad ek shakhs pakdega aur us se buland hoga. Phir usے doosra shakhs pakdega aur us se buland hoga. Phir usے doosra shakhs pakdega to us se toot jayegi. Phir us ke liye jodi jayegi aur us se buland hoga. Phir mujhe khabar dijiye Ya Rasulullah! Mere maan-baap Aap par fida hon. Main ne durust paya ya khata ki? Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tum ne kuchh durust paya aur kuchh khata ki. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Allah ki qasam! Tum mujhe zaroor wo bayan karoge jis mein main ne khata ki. Aap ne farmaya: Qasam na khao."
"1463","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Main ne apne aap ko miswak se miswak karte dekha. Phir mere paas do mard aaye, un mein se ek doosre se bada tha. Phir main ne miswak chhote ko di. Phir mujh se kaha gaya: Bade ki badayi karo. Phir main ne use bade ko diya."
"1464","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Main ne khwab mein dekha ke main Makkah se us zameen ki taraf hijrat karta hun jismein khajoor hain. Phir mera wahm gaya ke wo Yamama ya Hajar hai. Phir wo Madina hai, Yasrib. Aur main ne apne is khwab mein dekha ke main ne talwar hilayi aur us ka upar toot gaya. Phir wo hai jo mominon ko Uhud ke din pahuncha. Phir main ne use doosri se hilaya. Phir wo sab se achhi ho gayi jaisi thi. Phir wo hai jo Allah lekar aaya fatah se aur mominon ke jama hone se. Aur us mein gaayen dekhein. Aur Allah bhalayi hai. Phir wo Uhud ke din momin hain. Aur bhalayi wo hai jo Allah laya, bhalayi se aur sach ki sawab se jo Allah ne hamein Badr ke din ke baad di."
"1465","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Musailima Kazzab Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke zamane mein aaya. Phir kehne laga: Agar Muhammad mere liye apne baad de to main us ki pairwi karun. Aur wo apni qaum mein se bahut se logon mein aaya tha. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) us ki taraf aaye, jabke Aap ke sath Thabit bin Qais bin Shammas they. Aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hath mein khajoor ki tehni ka tukda tha. Yahan tak ke Musailima par us ke sathiyon mein thehre. Phir farmaya: Agar tum mujh se ye tukda mangoge to main tumhe nahi dunga. Aur tum Allah ke mamle mein apni had se nahi badhoge. Aur agar tum peeth pheroge to Allah tumhe halak karega. Aur beshak main tumhe wo dekhta hun jo mujhe us mein dikhaya gaya jo main ne dekha. Aur ye Thabit tumhe meri taraf se jawab dega. Phir Aap us se phire. Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Phir main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke qaul ke bare mein poochha: Beshak tum wo dikhaye gaye ho jo mujhe us mein dikhaya gaya jo main ne dekha."
"1466","[AI-translation] Phir mujhe Abu Hurairah ne khabar di: Ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab main soya tha to main ne apne dono hathon mein sone ke do kanghan dekhe. Phir mujhe un ke mamle ne fikr mein dala. Phir khwab mein meri taraf wahi ki gayi ke unhe phoonko. Phir main ne unhe phoonka aur wo ud gaye. Phir main ne un ki tabeer do jhooton se ki jo mere baad niklenge. Un mein se ek Ansi hai, doosra Musailima."
"1467","[AI-translation] Hazrat Samura bin Jundub (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) apne sahaba se kasrat se farmate: [Kya tum mein se kisi ne khwab dekha?] Unhon ne kaha: Phir Aap ko wo bayan karta jise Allah chahta ke bayan kare. Aur Aap ne ek subah farmaya: Beshak mere paas aaj raat aane wale aaye. Aur un dono ne mujhe uthaya. Aur un dono ne mujh se kaha: Chalo. Aur main un dono ke sath chala. Aur hum ek lete hue shakhs ke paas aaye, jabke doosra us par pathar se khada tha. Jab wo pathar se us ke sar par marta to us ka sar kuchal deta. Phir pathar yahan ludhak jata. Phir pathar ke peechhe jata aur use leta. Phir us ki taraf na lauta yahan tak ke us ka sar sehat-mand ho jata jaisa tha. Phir us ki taraf lauta aur us se waisa hi karta jaisa pehli martaba kiya tha. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne un dono se kaha: SubhanAllah! Ye dono kya hain? Unhon ne kaha: Un dono ne mujh se kaha: Chalo. Unhon ne kaha: Phir hum chale. Phir hum ek shakhs ke paas aaye jo apni peeth par leta tha, jabke doosra us par lohe ke aankde se khada tha. Jab wo us ke chehre ke ek hisse ke paas aata to us ka jabda guddi tak cheer deta, us ki naak guddi tak, us ki aankh guddi tak. Unhon ne kaha: Phir doosre hisse ki taraf phirta. Phir us se waisa hi karta jaisa pehle hisse se kiya tha. Phir us hisse se farigh na hota yahan tak ke wo hissa sehat-mand ho jata jaisa tha. Phir us ki taraf lauta aur us se waisa hi karta jaisa pehli martaba kiya tha. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: SubhanAllah! Ye dono kya hain? Unhon ne kaha: Un dono ne mujh se kaha: Chalo. Phir hum chale. Phir hum tandoor jaisi ke paas aaye. Phir us mein shor aur awazein thein. Unhon ne kaha: Phir hum ne us mein jhanka. Phir us mein nange mard aur aurtein thein. Jab un ke paas un ke neeche se lapak aati to jab wo lapak unhe aati to wo cheekhte. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne un dono se kaha: Ye kaun hain? Unhon ne kaha: Un dono ne mujh se kaha: Chalo, chalo. Unhon ne kaha: Phir hum chale. Phir hum surkh nahar ke paas aaye jo khoon jaisi thi. Jab us nahar mein tairne wala shakhs tairta tha, jabke nahar ke kinare ek shakhs tha jis ne us ke paas bahut se pathar jama kiye they. Jab wo tairne wala tairta jo tairta phir us ke paas aata jis ne us ke paas pathar jama kiye they to wo us ke liye apna munh kholta. Phir use pathar khilata. Phir wo tairne jata. Phir us ki taraf lauta. Jab bhi us ki taraf lauta to wo us ke liye apna munh kholta aur use pathar khilata. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne un dono se kaha: Ye dono kya hain? Unhon ne kaha: Un dono ne mujh se kaha: Chalo, chalo. Unhon ne kaha: Phir hum chale. Phir hum bad-surat shakhs ke paas aaye, sab se bad-surat jo tum mard ko dekhte ho, surat mein. Jab us ke paas aag thi jisे wo bhadkata tha aur us ke ird-gird daudta tha. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne un dono se kaha: Ye kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Un dono ne mujh se kaha: Chalo, chalo. Phir hum chale. Phir hum ghane bagh ke paas aaye jismein bahar ke har phool mein se tha. Jab bagh ke darmiyan lamba shakhs tha jis ka sar main lambayi mein aasman mein mushkil se dekhta tha. Jab us shakhs ke ird-gird sab se zyada bachche they jo main ne kabhi dekhe. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne un dono se kaha: Ye kya hai? Ye kaun hain? Unhon ne kaha: Un dono ne mujh se kaha: Chalo, chalo. Unhon ne kaha: Phir hum chale. Phir hum bade bagh pahunche. Main ne kabhi us se bada aur haseen bagh nahi dekha. Unhon ne kaha: Un dono ne mujh se kaha: Us mein chadho. Unhon ne kaha: Phir hum us mein chadhe. Phir hum sone ki eenton aur chandi ki eenton se bane sheher pahunche. Phir hum sheher ke darwaze aaye. Phir hum ne kholne ka sawal kiya. Phir hamare liye khola gaya. Phir hum us mein dakhil hue. Phir us mein hum se mard mile, un ki makhlooq ka aadha sab se haseen jo tum dekhte ho jaisa, aadha sab se bad-surat jo tum dekhte ho jaisa. Unhon ne kaha: Un dono ne un se kaha: Jao aur us nahar mein pado. Unhon ne kaha: Jab aadi nahar behti hui goya us ka pani safedi mein khalis doodh hai. Phir wo gaye aur us mein pade. Phir hamari taraf laute. Jab wo burayi un se door ho chuki thi. Phir wo sab se achhi surat mein ho gaye. Unhon ne kaha: Un dono ne mujh se kaha: Ye Jannat-e-Adn hai. Aur ye tumhara maskan hai. Unhon ne kaha: Phir meri nazar upar uthi. Phir mahal safed badal jaisa tha. Unhon ne kaha: Un dono ne mujh se kaha: Wo tumhara maskan hai. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne un dono se kaha: Allah tum dono mein barkat de. Mujhe chhoro ke main us mein dakhil hun. Un dono ne kaha: Ab nahi, jabke tum us mein dakhil hoge. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne un dono se kaha: Beshak main ne aaj raat se ta'ajjub dekha hai. Phir ye kya hai jo main ne dekha? Unhon ne kaha: Un dono ne mujh se kaha: Suno! Hum tumhe khabar denge. Raha pehla shakhs jis ke paas tum aaye jis ka sar pathar se kuchla jata hai, wo wo shakhs hai jo Quran leta hai aur use chhorta hai. Aur farz namaz se sota hai. Aur raha wo shakhs jis ke paas tum aaye jis ka jabda guddi tak cheera jata hai, us ki naak guddi tak, us ki aankh guddi tak, wo wo shakhs hai jo apne ghar se subah nikalta hai aur jhoot bolta hai jo ufuq tak pahunchta hai. Aur rahe wo nange mard aur aurtein jo tandoor ki imarat jaisi mein hain, wo zaniya mard aur aurtein hain. Aur raha wo shakhs jis ke paas tum aaye jo nahar mein tairta hai aur use pathar khilaya jata hai, wo sood khane wala hai. Aur raha bad-surat shakhs jo aag ke paas hai, use bhadkata hai aur us ke ird-gird daudta hai, wo Malik hai, Jahannam ka darban. Aur raha lamba shakhs jo bagh mein hai, wo Ibrahim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hain. Aur rahe bachche jo us ke ird-gird hain, har bachcha jo fitrat par mara. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Musalmanon mein se kuchh ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Aur mushrikon ke bachche? To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Aur mushrikon ke bachche. Aur rahi wo qaum jo aadhi achhi aur aadhi buri thi, wo wo qaum hai jinhon ne nek aur bura amal milaya. Allah ne un se darguzar farmaya."
